1
00:00:00,130 --> 00:00:02,330
(Leonard:)that says you can do CPR
on birds.

2
00:00:02,332 --> 00:00:03,632
Great! Do it!

3
00:00:03,633 --> 00:00:05,463
(Leonard:)I'm not doing it.
You killed him, you do it.

4
00:00:05,468 --> 00:00:07,438
(Raj:)I'll do it.
No.

5
00:00:07,437 --> 00:00:08,267
(Howard:)I need to do it.

6
00:00:08,271 --> 00:00:10,241
(Howard:)This is on me.

7
00:00:14,578 --> 00:00:16,278
(Leonard:)Okay.

8
00:00:16,279 --> 00:00:19,279
"Mouth over beak
and light chest compressions."

9
00:00:19,282 --> 00:00:20,282
(Raj:)Don't blow too hard.

10
00:00:20,283 --> 00:00:23,083
(Raj:)If you pop him, I will vomit.

11
00:00:24,554 --> 00:00:26,524
(Leonard:)Anything?

12
00:00:26,523 --> 00:00:28,393
(raspy):
I am tasting a lot of Slim Jim.

13
00:00:28,391 --> 00:00:29,321
(coughs)

14
00:00:32,295 --> 00:00:34,725
Wait, wait, his wing moved!

15
00:00:34,731 --> 00:00:36,661
Oh, he blinked his eyes!
He's alive!

16
00:00:36,666 --> 00:00:38,366
It's a Christmas miracle!

17
00:00:38,368 --> 00:00:40,868
(Howard:)I might argue a Hanukkah
miracle, but I'll take it.

18
00:00:40,871 --> 00:00:43,541
(Howard:)Come on, little guy, let's get
you outside. Get the curtain.

19
00:00:44,507 --> 00:00:46,907
(bird caws)

20
00:00:51,281 --> 00:01:00,021
(Raj:)Someone should really
close that loading door.

